WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Safex

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.937
Candy and the other nurses leave
to St. Joanna Hospital in Chicago.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:14.808
Candy met a wounded boy
in the busy hospital.

00:00:15.008 --> 00:00:17.307
She helped him right away.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:34.194
Grandfather's mansion

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:41.827
Candy, you take that bed.
I will sleep in this one.

00:00:41.977 --> 00:00:42.999
Ok

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.837
Please.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.044
- Relax.
- Yes.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:53.284
- You can come in.
- Yes.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:02.452
You have two free days,
starting from today.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.820
A break?

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.590
There is enough time.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:14.371
I would like to see
Stear, Archie and Annie.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:19.502
There will be a series of hard training
from the day after tomorrow.

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.468
You need to be prepared for it.

00:01:21.618 --> 00:01:22.707
Yes.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.775
That's all. Good-bye!

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:32.714
Everyone, let's go to downtown!

00:01:32.904 --> 00:01:35.606
- Good idea!
- Let's go together, Franny.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.003
Alright, group activity is important.

00:01:41.153 --> 00:01:45.496
We can build up our team spirit
by doing things together.

00:01:45.646 --> 00:01:46.765
Right, Candy?

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:53.138
I won't be able to meet them.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:56.107
Next time, maybe.

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.951
Candy!

00:02:08.101 --> 00:02:09.852
Stear! Archie!

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.208
You really came to Chicago, Candy!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.096
I thought I was having a dream
when I received the letter.

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.533
Are they your friends from Joseph Hospital?

00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:22.797
Her name is Franny.

00:02:22.947 --> 00:02:24.235
Stear and Archie.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.810
Nice to meet you.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.993
And Judy, Natalie, Eleanor.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.941
Nice to meet you.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:34.518
Nice to meet you.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:38.017
Candy, a gift from us.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.217
"Welcome to Chicago".

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:43.119
Great placard!

00:02:43.269 --> 00:02:45.800
Pull that string.

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.756
What's this?

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.972
It's great, it came out quick!

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.834
Are you alright, Candy?

00:03:01.984 --> 00:03:03.843
Brother's inventions always have problems.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.010
Sorry, Candy.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.215
Actually, we came to pick you up.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.284
Annie is almost here.

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:16.252
Annie? I miss her so much!

00:03:16.402 --> 00:03:19.227
Let's go together!

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.761
Stear and Archie,
thanks for your invitation.

00:03:23.911 --> 00:03:26.737
We are just about
to have a tour in downtown.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.701
Candy, don't worry about us.

00:03:30.851 --> 00:03:31.764
Franny

00:03:31.914 --> 00:03:35.211
Ladies, how about going together,
in the car?

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.674
City tour in a car!
Thank you!

00:03:39.824 --> 00:03:43.813
Deal! We will be the guides.

00:03:43.963 --> 00:03:45.322
Get on!

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:51.000
Franny, please.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.003
Let's go!

00:04:08.615 --> 00:04:10.749
It is a big city.

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.977
I want to see Lake Michigan.

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:16.919
No problem, Judy!

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.989
Stear is so nice.

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:22.755
I like Archie.

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:31.904
Patty and Annie will be mad.

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:47.186
I always wanted to visit Lake Michigan.
It's spectacular!

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:53.020
It reminds me of....

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:54.587
...Lakewood.

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:57.851
We were so happy back then.

00:04:58.001 --> 00:04:59.889
Now everything has changed.

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:03.528
Archie's summer is gone.

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:07.268
Stear's water fence is gone.

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.125
Anthony's roses.

00:05:20.453 --> 00:05:22.444
A blooming rose garden.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:33.624
The days at Lakewood will never come back.

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:45.108
Sweet memories,

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.543
and....

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.950
sad memories,

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:56.614
still lie deeply in my heart.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.155
Let's go, Candy!

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:07.820
Franny

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.401
Did you recall the past, too?

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:15.797
What I recall...

00:06:16.109 --> 00:06:17.474
is not important.

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:22.471
Franny has something in her mind,

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:26.311
but she doesn’t want
to open her heart to us.

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:35.487
That's the Adleys' company!

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:41.931
These too!

00:06:45.004 --> 00:06:48.863
The Adley family owns a lot of banks
and companies in Chicago.

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:54.203
The president of the bank
is Eliza's father.

00:06:54.353 --> 00:06:55.903
Mr. Leagan?

00:06:56.053 --> 00:06:59.974
Look! That trading company is also ours.

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:05.779
What's wrong, Candy?

00:07:05.929 --> 00:07:07.881
It opened my eyes.

00:07:08.031 --> 00:07:09.887
Grandfather William is amazing.

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:11.519
It's true.

00:07:11.669 --> 00:07:15.397
Even I cannot believe how much
fortune and influence Grandfather has.

00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:17.292
The Adleys are amazing!

00:07:17.442 --> 00:07:21.315
Candy,
you are one of the Adleys, too!

00:07:21.565 --> 00:07:23.274
Candy?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.268
Yes. Candy was adopted by the Adleys.

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:28.914
Didn't you know that?

00:07:31.384 --> 00:07:35.047
It was before, not anymore.

00:07:35.455 --> 00:07:37.520
What are you talking about?

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.386
You are still their daughter!

00:07:41.727 --> 00:07:42.955
Stop the car!

00:07:45.531 --> 00:07:46.541
What happened?

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:48.923
I am going home.

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:50.569
Franny!

00:07:51.204 --> 00:07:55.031
Candy, I was wrong about you.

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:56.995
Franny...

00:07:57.145 --> 00:07:59.266
You are from a rich family.

00:07:59.416 --> 00:08:01.872
Being a nurse is just a hobby to you.

00:08:02.049 --> 00:08:06.474
We... No, I am different.

00:08:06.624 --> 00:08:11.019
This is my lifelong job, not a joke.

00:08:11.291 --> 00:08:15.018
Me too.

00:08:15.528 --> 00:08:17.393
Franny

00:08:17.563 --> 00:08:19.758
Judy, Natalie, Ellie.

00:08:19.999 --> 00:08:21.466
Me too.

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:24.289
I want to be on my own,

00:08:24.439 --> 00:08:26.564
and distinguish myself from the Adleys.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.466
Candy!

00:08:28.616 --> 00:08:31.134
I am leaving now.

00:08:32.378 --> 00:08:33.845
Wait, Franny.

00:08:37.917 --> 00:08:40.708
Candy, sorry, we are going back, too.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.012
Good-bye.

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:44.949
Sorry.

00:08:52.632 --> 00:08:54.259
It's...

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.993
It's not a joke to me.

00:09:01.143 --> 00:09:03.006
I really...

00:09:03.342 --> 00:09:06.270
really want to be a nurse!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.941
We understand, Candy.

00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:13.981
But you don't need to give up
being an Adley.

00:09:14.787 --> 00:09:18.655
Stear, Archie, you don't understand!

00:09:21.794 --> 00:09:23.091
Candy!

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:27.294
Stear, take me to the Adley residence.

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:31.228
I thought about bringing you there.

00:09:32.872 --> 00:09:37.296
I know I left them, but...

00:09:37.446 --> 00:09:43.406
I want to apologize
and ask them to listen to my reason.

00:09:44.216 --> 00:09:46.646
Then I would feel better.

00:10:02.301 --> 00:10:05.031
It's the Adley's front door.

00:10:11.844 --> 00:10:13.106
Stop the car!

00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:17.003
What's wrong, Candy?

00:10:17.223 --> 00:10:19.514
I am a little scared.

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:24.782
What are you talking about?
It's your home.

00:10:25.224 --> 00:10:26.355
Isn't it, Candy?

00:10:27.059 --> 00:10:28.424
No...

00:10:29.128 --> 00:10:33.497
Of course you can still go in there,
because you haven't told Grandfather!

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:36.262
Alright.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.364
I am Candice White Adley.

00:10:41.207 --> 00:10:44.005
But I will be only Candice White
when I'll come out.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.590
Stear, Archie, welcome back!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:08.599
The person in the car...

00:11:09.235 --> 00:11:10.429
Candy!

00:11:13.506 --> 00:11:14.837
Eliza!

00:11:16.676 --> 00:11:18.868
You are here.

00:11:19.011 --> 00:11:19.965
Eliza, you are here!

00:11:20.115 --> 00:11:22.104
How come you are here, Eliza?

00:11:22.815 --> 00:11:25.648
I came to see Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:11:25.885 --> 00:11:27.648
Eliza, is the car here?

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.113
This guy is here, too?

00:11:32.591 --> 00:11:35.082
I was just wondering.

00:11:35.327 --> 00:11:37.454
So hard to get rid of.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.955
The orphan from Pony's Home
is really something.

00:11:41.967 --> 00:11:43.422
Stear, get away!

00:11:43.572 --> 00:11:45.704
Grand Aunt Elroy said I could use the car.

00:11:49.642 --> 00:11:51.130
Get on, Eliza!

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:54.436
Wait, let me spray some perfume.

00:11:54.586 --> 00:11:57.710
I don't like the smell of an orphan.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.219
Let's go!

00:12:05.691 --> 00:12:07.352
I hope you crash the car!

00:12:09.228 --> 00:12:13.062
I am sorry,
I didn't expect they would be here.

00:12:13.466 --> 00:12:16.094
It's really not my day,
to see someone I dislike.

00:12:16.368 --> 00:12:19.791
Forget about them. Eliza said...

00:12:19.941 --> 00:12:23.328
They came to visit Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:12:23.478 --> 00:12:25.836
Grand Aunt doesn't feel well?

00:12:25.986 --> 00:12:28.400
Not really, just high blood pressure.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.739
She's doing the same as before.

00:12:30.889 --> 00:12:33.080
Say high to Grand Aunt Elroy first.

00:12:36.956 --> 00:12:38.184
Here

00:12:38.624 --> 00:12:41.650
Stear, Archie, I can get in by myself.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.658
Come in.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.473
Long time no see, Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:13:04.216 --> 00:13:05.976
Is it you, Candy?

00:13:06.226 --> 00:13:08.010
Yes, Grand Aunt.

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:13.450
I heard you left England
and returned to Pony's Home.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.618
Yes, Grand Aunt.

00:13:17.463 --> 00:13:21.490
I came to explain this to you.

00:13:21.867 --> 00:13:23.625
Look at the way you talk.

00:13:23.775 --> 00:13:26.801
You forgot the upper class manner?

00:13:27.011 --> 00:13:28.798
Grand Aunt.

00:13:28.948 --> 00:13:31.968
This is the way I talk now.

00:13:32.678 --> 00:13:36.341
I am studying right now
and will become a nurse.

00:13:38.384 --> 00:13:41.353
The Adleys have always been nobles...

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.210
Brother,

00:13:43.622 --> 00:13:47.683
it's not a good idea
for her to see Grand Aunt.

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:52.155
She is here anyway.
there is no reason not to see Grand Aunt.

00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:54.321
You have no shame at all!

00:13:54.471 --> 00:13:57.767
It was a mistake to adopt you.

00:13:58.604 --> 00:14:01.640
I want to talk to Grandfather William
about this issue.

00:14:02.975 --> 00:14:04.567
What?

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:07.444
I wrote him a letter about this.

00:14:07.713 --> 00:14:09.180
I...

00:14:09.582 --> 00:14:11.573
I want to give up being
the foster child of the family.

00:14:13.018 --> 00:14:14.559
Give up?

00:14:15.087 --> 00:14:18.420
Can I discuss this with Grand Aunt?

00:14:18.891 --> 00:14:20.446
Of course not!

00:14:20.596 --> 00:14:24.117
I absolutely agree with that!

00:14:24.267 --> 00:14:28.624
Grandfather William makes the final
decision. I can't decide anything.

00:14:28.874 --> 00:14:31.559
Where is Grandfather William right now?

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:33.193
I am sorry.

00:14:33.343 --> 00:14:37.065
I get a headache
by just seeing you! Get out!

00:14:37.215 --> 00:14:42.044
Please pass on my message to him.

00:14:42.314 --> 00:14:44.509
I can't believe this!

00:14:44.783 --> 00:14:48.014
You have been making
nothing but troubles for him.

00:14:50.522 --> 00:14:53.047
- Grand Aunt!
- Get out!

00:14:55.294 --> 00:14:57.728
Stear, Archie, come here!

00:15:00.165 --> 00:15:01.498
Grand Aunt!

00:15:07.106 --> 00:15:08.835
Here! Are you alright?

00:15:09.408 --> 00:15:10.466
Is this ok?

00:15:21.253 --> 00:15:24.347
I don't want to see you, get out!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:28.492
Grand Aunt Elroy! Getting angry
will higher your blood pressure.

00:15:28.994 --> 00:15:31.002
It's you who gave me high blood pressure!

00:15:32.197 --> 00:15:33.891
Calm down, Grand Aunt Elroy!

00:15:34.741 --> 00:15:37.692
Stear, Archie, I am going outside.

00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:50.912
How is Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.176
She is calm now.

00:15:53.326 --> 00:15:54.718
I am sorry, Candy,

00:15:55.087 --> 00:15:56.243
about Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:15:56.393 --> 00:15:59.415
Can't she be nicer to people?

00:15:59.692 --> 00:16:01.626
Grandfather is not home?

00:16:02.828 --> 00:16:05.001
Actually, he has never lived here.

00:16:05.201 --> 00:16:08.292
Then why did you say he was here?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.990
Actually, Candy...

00:16:14.974 --> 00:16:17.101
Annie, we've been waiting for you!

00:16:17.609 --> 00:16:18.906
Annie!

00:16:19.078 --> 00:16:20.443
Candy!

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.109
- Annie!
- Candy!

00:16:24.683 --> 00:16:26.412
I missed you so much, Candy!

00:16:27.219 --> 00:16:28.876
Me, too, Annie.

00:16:29.026 --> 00:16:30.009
Driver!

00:16:30.159 --> 00:16:32.886
I will take Annie home later.
You can go now.

00:16:35.728 --> 00:16:39.061
It feels like a dream
to see you in Chicago.

00:16:39.999 --> 00:16:41.830
Me, too, Annie.

00:16:42.368 --> 00:16:46.730
Let's celebrate downtown!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.204
Good idea!

00:16:48.574 --> 00:16:52.132
Stear, Archie,
I am very happy right now, but I can't.

00:16:52.282 --> 00:16:52.936
Why not?

00:16:53.186 --> 00:16:56.001
I am worried about Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:16:56.251 --> 00:17:00.276
She'll be fine,
the doctor will be here soon.

00:17:01.226 --> 00:17:03.814
Let's wait until the doctor is here.

00:17:10.629 --> 00:17:12.187
She fell asleep.

00:17:22.007 --> 00:17:24.100
She has high fever!

00:17:33.352 --> 00:17:36.014
An expert is an expert, right, brother?

00:17:36.655 --> 00:17:39.715
I want Candy to take care of me
when I get sick.

00:17:56.275 --> 00:17:57.799
Grand Aunt Elroy!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.137
It's Eliza! Let's hide!

00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:05.515
Are you in there, Grand Aunt Elroy?
I am coming!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:11.817
What's wrong, Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:18:13.725 --> 00:18:15.818
Grand Aunt Elroy

00:18:16.662 --> 00:18:18.425
Eliza...

00:18:19.198 --> 00:18:21.029
You have been taking care of me?

00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:26.196
It's very nice of you, Eliza.

00:18:27.046 --> 00:18:30.270
It's my pleasure.

00:18:31.343 --> 00:18:32.898
Eliza is lying!

00:18:33.048 --> 00:18:34.233
It was Candy!

00:18:34.383 --> 00:18:35.870
It doesn't matter, Archie.

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.145
I don't need people's approval,

00:18:39.318 --> 00:18:41.804
it is my job.

00:18:42.521 --> 00:18:43.852
Candy

00:18:44.189 --> 00:18:49.627
I didn't think you would be so mature.

00:18:51.563 --> 00:18:53.622
I feel ashamed.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:55.854
Please.

00:18:56.004 --> 00:18:57.459
Grand Aunt Elroy, what happened?

00:18:57.609 --> 00:19:00.427
I had a headache and I fainted.

00:19:00.577 --> 00:19:01.471
That's too bad!

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:05.037
What made you so angry?

00:19:05.878 --> 00:19:06.967
Forget it.

00:19:07.117 --> 00:19:10.048
Was it Candy, Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:19:10.516 --> 00:19:12.403
Where did that girl go?

00:19:13.093 --> 00:19:15.713
I don't know, I haven't seen her.

00:19:15.921 --> 00:19:17.910
Tell her to come back when you find her.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:19.456
Yes, Grand Aunt Elroy.

00:19:19.725 --> 00:19:22.118
Were you taking care of Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:19:22.268 --> 00:19:23.716
Yes.

00:19:23.966 --> 00:19:26.654
Good job!

00:19:26.804 --> 00:19:29.423
I was just doing
what I was supposed to do.

00:19:29.573 --> 00:19:32.402
Eliza is a good kid.

00:19:32.571 --> 00:19:33.663
Liar!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.875
Grand Aunt Elroy, it was...

00:19:39.144 --> 00:19:40.611
It was Candy!

00:19:40.879 --> 00:19:43.347
Why are you hiding there?

00:19:44.016 --> 00:19:47.004
Doctor, Candy is a nurse.

00:19:48.754 --> 00:19:50.113
That's what I thought.

00:19:50.263 --> 00:19:53.383
Candy is the Adleys' foster child.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.750
I feel much relieved that
there is a nurse in the family.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:01.321
Unforgivable!

00:20:02.034 --> 00:20:03.260
Grand Aunt Elroy!

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:07.707
I am not allowing anyone in the Adley
family to be a nurse!

00:20:08.007 --> 00:20:11.130
Being a nurse is an honorable job.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:15.236
I don't care if it's honorable or not!

00:20:16.014 --> 00:20:19.916
The Adley ladies
cannot do what the common people do.

00:20:20.452 --> 00:20:21.408
Grand Aunt Elroy!

00:20:21.758 --> 00:20:24.243
Is this what you give her in return
for what she has done?

00:20:24.393 --> 00:20:25.310
Stear!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:28.325
Candy helped you to bring down the fever.

00:20:29.561 --> 00:20:32.530
She is the family's foster child,
it's what she is supposed to do.

00:20:33.098 --> 00:20:36.459
Grand Aunt Elroy,
can Candy stay over tonight?

00:20:36.709 --> 00:20:38.532
Of course not!

00:20:40.272 --> 00:20:43.002
Candy and Annie have not spent
time together for a long time.

00:20:43.342 --> 00:20:47.404
Please allow them to stay over tonight,
please!

00:20:47.654 --> 00:20:50.509
You people talk too much.

00:20:51.116 --> 00:20:54.409
Grand Aunt Elroy won't say yes.

00:20:54.559 --> 00:20:55.882
Right, Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:20:57.089 --> 00:21:01.826
How could I forgive her so easily?

00:21:04.763 --> 00:21:08.722
Grand Aunt Elroy is very quiet.

00:21:09.668 --> 00:21:15.766
Maybe it's her way
of expressing her gratitude.
